{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Simulator</strong> is a realistic, first-person welding simulation that allows you to learn and master various metal joining and cutting techniques. In the game, you will play the role of a welder who gains experience by performing various tasks. You will learn <strong>MMA, MIG and TIG</strong> methods, and you will be able to experiment with different materials and tools to create precise and durable structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/tig.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Welding Techniques</strong> \u2013 practice MMA, MIG, and TIG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting and Processing</strong> \u2013 precisely cut and adjust elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Projects</strong> \u2013 create metal tables, bike frames, go-karts and other complex structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/szafka2.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop Customization</strong> \u2013 upgrade gear, organize tools, and expand your space.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 earn money, invest in equipment, and tackle bigger challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/grind3.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re just starting out or looking to sharpen your technique, Welding Simulator offers a safe, accessible way to explore the craft of welding.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035150?t=1758276446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/5a4f5e4131af3e976405b3d5a315ed8e39b79180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758276446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/dcbce3fc9e5ea5fea5f13ef991b2fc3bd6bc2b40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758276446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/dcbce3fc9e5ea5fea5f13ef991b2fc3bd6bc2b40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758276446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Simulator</strong> is a realistic, first-person welding simulation that allows you to learn and master various metal joining and cutting techniques. In the game, you will play the role of a welder who gains experience by performing various tasks. You will learn <strong>MMA, MIG and TIG</strong> methods, and you will be able to experiment with different materials and tools to create precise and durable structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/tig.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Welding Techniques</strong> \u2013 practice MMA, MIG, and TIG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting and Processing</strong> \u2013 precisely cut and adjust elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Projects</strong> \u2013 create metal tables, bike frames, go-karts and other complex structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/szafka2.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop Customization</strong> \u2013 upgrade gear, organize tools, and expand your space.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 earn money, invest in equipment, and tackle bigger challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/extras/grind3.gif?t=1758276446\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re just starting out or looking to sharpen your technique, Welding Simulator offers a safe, accessible way to explore the craft of welding.</p>","developers":["DM Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035150/11a68c103b76f84e4e381b0fb1d393e5d9bb5620/header.jpg?t=1758276446","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257199836,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199836/movie480.mp4?t=1758276444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199836/movie_max.mp4?t=1758276444"},"name":"Welding Simulator Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571998